WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.972
The Chat Interactions card sets the default Chat mode of chat interactions, and

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:10.330
whether answers can be played aloud.

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:14.733
The Documents card controls what people can attach to a chat.

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:19.568
The MCP Server card controls the server that lets other tools use your site.

00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:23.873
The Memory card turns on user memory, and chooses its index and how

00:00:23.873 --> 00:00:25.642
many memories come back.

00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:30.207
Prompt Security and Visitor Identity protect public assistants.

00:00:30.207 --> 00:00:32.473
Each of these has its own video.

